SUMMARY:Phil's Hills: Sheep Hill Repeats
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Ride Leader:** Phil New
 swanger\n\n**Phil’s Hills**: a series of structured hill repeat rides de
 signed to build strength\, endurance and boost your overall fitness.\n\n**
 Route link:** [Phil's Hills: Sheep Hill Repeats](https://ridewithgps.com/r
 outes/55245137)\n**PDF link:** [Cuesheet](https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.c
 om/assets.modomadethis.com/cuesheets/Phils_Hills_Sheep_Hill_Repeats.pdf)\n
 \nWhat to Expect:\n\n* **Route:** Expect a total distance of approximately
  **15-20 miles**\, including **3-4 loops** of a circuit featuring **1-2 cl
 imbing segment**.\n* **Focus:** We'll emphasize maintaining a consistent c
 limbing tempo\, active recovery between efforts\, and repeating the effort
  to build power and efficiency.\n* **Pace:** We'll maintain a comfortable 
 average pace range of **14-16 mph**.\n* **No-Drop Policy:** You'll never b
 e left behind! We'll regroup after climbs to ensure everyone stays togethe
 r.\n\n\\-\\-\\-\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds or audible music-play
 ing devices. Please bring water\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tir
 e levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3150443
