SUMMARY:FreeOnFriday? Round Barn Roundup 20R
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRIDE LEADER: Jan Zerfoss\
 , average pace 12-14 mph.\nCue and Ride with GPS link: [Round Barn Roundup
  Winter](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/49013911)\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, 
 and Ride Together**\n\nThis is a casual ride and the ride leader will ride
  at the advertised pace. Some riders may ride faster than the leader so we
 'll likely break into one or more smaller groups. We will stop to regroup 
 periodically. Please stay with other riders in your pace group so everyone
  has someone to ride with and nobody is riding solo. Usually no designated
  sweep but nobody will get dropped.\n\nMiddle Creek Visitor Center has wel
 l maintained restrooms that are usually open.\n\nPost-ride coffee/refreshm
 ents - BYO to enjoy on the grounds of the visitor center.\n\nHelmets are m
 andatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tub
 e\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen
  and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below t
 o join this ride. Being on\nMeetup does not mean you are a club member. Jo
 in here [Member Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?pag
 e_id=60&club_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the clu
 b's Code of Conduct: [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/c
 ontent.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\nGuidance if an 
 incident occurs: [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.
 aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3151215
